		<description><![CDATA[It seems that the good old USA is a very good psychopath trap.  There are vast opportunities to quickly accumulate power or so it seems.  Truth is the three branches of government or to some degree any republic is designed to be stagnant, deadlocked, and inept.  It&#8217;s built to attract the most people who are [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Is the United States government a psychopath trap?" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/132" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-googleplus"><!-- Google Plus One--><div class="g-plusone" data-size="medium" data-href="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/132"></div></div>
